      "message": "This seems like it\u0027s combining two different tests in a confusing way. I would expect that the tests in ap_power exercise the ap_power code specifically (which it already does), and the per-board customizations should be tested on their own under the assumption that the power sequencer will call those customized functions at the appropriate times (which is tested by the ap_power tests).\n\nTo test nissa\u0027s board_power.c, I expected we would add a test suite to the nissa directory that called the board_* functions directly (without actually building ap_power for that test), avoiding tendrils of ap_power reaching out into every project; then the versions of the extension functions in test/ap_power/ should be written in such a way that the tests can verify they were actually called as expected.",
